@startuml first-run
!include _theme.puml

title Your first login — reaching the gisnix commands

start
:Log in to the COSMIC desktop;
:Open a terminal (kitty);
:Go to your machine's flake\n**cd ~/nixos-config**;
:Enter the tools\n**nix develop**;
:Type **gisnix**\nthe command compendium;
stop

note right
  From here everything is a `gisnix` command:
  **gisnix configure** to choose software,
  **gisnix update** to rebuild, **gisnix locale**
  to change your timezone, and so on. Typing
  **gisnix** on its own lists them all.
end note
@enduml
